      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since, $Q$ is the point for which $P Q$ is bisected perpendicularly by the initial line $(X$ -axis). Therefore, $Q$ will be the image of $P$ in $X$ -axis\r\n$\\therefore$ Coordinates of $Q$ is $(2, \\pi / 4)$\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2019_mat_a60.png\">",
